  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>生态硬件接口</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 资源入口</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">为帮助智能硬件开发者快速接入比亚迪AIoT生态，我们提供完整的硬件接口规范文档，涵盖</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">螺纹生态接口（供电）、椅背生态接口、中控生态接口</span><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，及面向生态硬件接口外接件的一般约束，如下图 1-1。开发者完成企业实名认证并签署《比亚迪AIoT业务服务协议》后，可前往【</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/IoTHardwareInterface\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">管理中心-生态硬件接口</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">】获取详细技术资料。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ac5836d9969d426d9b4118d2bdfbd554.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-33f46acfb0e04aaf8127f197686b285b-0-1ddadb86f8a2a45f24696edff90ef3ccb7ac1afa494d8802c477d7a53cf7744e\" alt=\"布局2 - 副本.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1048.84px;height: 465.45px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 硬件接口规范目录</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 生态硬件接口简介</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">生态硬件接口作为汽车智慧座舱实现硬件即插即用、场景按需组合、生态开放增值的核心技术载体，依据车规级可靠性、EMC兼容性及模块化拓展要求，基于机械-电气分层解耦、多接口协同工作的设计原则，明确</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>螺纹生态接口（供电）、椅背生态接口、中控生态接口</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">的结构安装、供电能力、通讯方式、电气接口、注意事项，构建起固定-快拆-盲插的全场景连接能力体系，推动座舱硬件向车规级模块化、灵活拓展的技术架构升级，最终支撑个性化座舱场景定制、第三方生态资源接入与商业价值增值的全业务闭环。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">如您已经完成企业实名认证并签署</span><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">《比亚迪AIoT业务服务协议》，可</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/protocolDetail?id=289\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">点击这里</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">获取资料详情。下图是生态硬件接口和部分外接件的示意图，详细资料请前往【</span><a href=\"#/researchTools/IoTHardwareInterface\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">管理中心-生态硬件接口</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">】获取。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ecf2770142684c4e8973fffc0278028e.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-5747dc2cb2884c1da157b5b0a943fb07-0-3e5158d1aef381f16d88f9c4be90916dc5a5d602d39e08ac4145b2494e2059b4\" alt=\"接口2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1032.92px;height: 640.23px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 螺纹生态接口（供电）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5bbef20a3e304eef979c2a7072b03e1c.png?auth_key=1795678277-93925c921f0940db832c269253ed17fe-0-1c9ae0ca88fda34c868ea33d3ad00d86b41fae2270de26882a64b0a79f08d42e\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1022.99px;height: 647.05px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-2 椅背生态接口</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/39cfa7c9cd3c411abec9a9723247c46b.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-4ea2cf202e0d41398156d88a82857b1c-0-e1f95fdd89e5f6e215ac5e465d7542d280f7e649f75b0c4fc19ca2950d90d893\" alt=\"84604021357fedd60970d6f359d1e584_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1017.97px;height: 1017.97px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(100, 106, 115); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-3 中控生态接口</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:530\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=462></col><col width=466></col><col width=465></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 421px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d186558b4be24ddd90362b5e6133ba5e.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-8ee078b948ff44d798a5c1e50263725b-0-60f5d60ad10c6bcea564cf38871fbd6c3f40b098f4b426ffc07e807f1ec44ae2\" alt=\"4cc341048fd48bc960a82d106f7d0cff_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件1</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/64e11d000abe4593b16a388111fe6bac.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-38dfd7d0f2df462f914567f485bcf8e5-0-855ebc5570721b59b3190070d9b1ba97d82d433bbfd8269676ecf78744740fa0\" alt=\"917b5d3febead827e65b04500f9d8560_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件2</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1896ebbbd362431296d1d65d0f826b33.jpg?auth_key=1795678277-9d1e495b21224761b87128901749f0c1-0-00cdbed457eab87822c1b25f24d82d88ff5413fe7131c775f1d3467a3ec6fb6f\" alt=\"e430be597816625660d82a0f20544246_compress.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-4 中控生态接口外接件3</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p>"
